<title>UK: BOE allots 180 mln stg in outright bills, repos.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 180 mln stg in outright bills, repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 180 million stg of assistance.</p>
<p>It allotted 20 million stg in bills outright and 160 million stg in repos to May 12 and 13.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
